{{DISPLAYTITLE: <span class="text-legendary";">Princess</span>}}
{{Protection}}{{MagicWords}}{{Card Infobox|Cost=3|Rarity=Legendary|Type=Troop|Arena=Electro Valley|ReleaseDate=29 February 2016}}{{SubpageNavBox|MergeTactics=yes|Evolution=yes}}{{Quote|This stunning Princess shoots flaming arrows from long range. If you're feeling warm feelings towards her, it's probably because you're on fire.}}

The Princess is a {{Rarity|Legendary}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from the [[Arenas|Electro Valley (Arena 11)]]. It spawns an area-damage, air-targeting, very long-ranged, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with low hitpoints and moderate damage. She resembles a woman with brown eyes, short black hair and eyebrows, wearing a golden crown, a chestplate, chain mail, a team-colored robe and leggings, brown gloves, belt with a crown buckle, and boots, carries a quiver on her back, and wields a bow with a team-colored handle and arrows with team-colored fletchings. A Princess card costs 3 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

