==History==
2016
*The Princess [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 29/2/2016, in the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]].
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Princess' hitpoints by 10%.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], decreased the {{Rarity|Legendary}} card Level cap to 5 (from 6) and fixed the "range bug" and decreased the Princess' range to 9 tiles (from 9.5 tiles), but her effective range is unchanged. The same update also changed her card description. Prior to this update, it read "''Shoots a volley of flaming arrows halfway across the Arena. The Princess is afraid of germs, so keep the rabble away from her!''"
*On 24/8/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (24/8/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Princess' area radius to 2 tiles (from 2.5 tiles).
*On 29/8/2016, a [[Version History#Minor Update (29/8/2016)|Minor Update]], increased the Princess' projectile speed to 450 (from 400).
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5).
2019
*On 6/5/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/5/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Princess' projectile speed to 600 (from 450).
2020
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]], added a card render to the Princess' card info screen.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Princess from Royal Arena to Spell Valley.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 27/6/2022, the [[Version History#Summer%202022%20Update%20(27/6/2022)|Summer 2022 Update]], added the Efficient Attacker [[Card Mastery]] task for the Princess.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Princess from Royal Arena to Electro Valley.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Princess' deployment time to 1.2 seconds (from 1 second) and decreased her first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.5 seconds).
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Princess' damage by 0.59%.

